# IndieAPI Environment Variables

# Home Assistant Configuration
HomeAssistant__BaseUrl=https://your-ha-instance.com
HomeAssistant__Token=your-long-lived-access-token

# Immich Configuration
Immich__BaseUrl=https://your-immich-instance.com
Immich__ApiKey=your-immich-api-key
Immich__AlbumIds__0=your-album-id

# Data Path for Markdown Articles
Projects__Directory=path-to-projects-markdown-directory
Blogs__Directory=path-to-blogs-markdown-directory